      "created_at": "2018-08-05T20:10:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Turns out that OA was listed in there, just not in the place I expected to find it. Inattentional blindness stinks. :P</p><p>Therefore, 3250 should be right for the standards; OA has 12 oversized cards, which makes me think the total oversized is 69.</p><p>At this point, the only thing I think is missing from the tally is the villain foil pack. I can count the number of things I have in there later if it helps you.</p>",
