      "raw": "<p>3,079, if you have no duplicates of anything.</p><p>Add 67 if you have both the individually released variants and the Complete Hero Variant Collection.</p><p>Add 110 if you have the Foil Hero Collection.</p><p>Add one if you have Foil Kvothe.</p><p>The total is 3,257 -- off by seven from the BGG list linked above. My guess is that the BGG post didn&#39;t include the turn order and battle zone cards in OblivAeon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, add one if you have Cleverest Legacy!</p>",
